OL,3,ARussian bombing kills 26 people at
OL,4,AUkraine aid centre, Kyiv says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 26 people were killed after
OL,7,FRussian bombs hit an aid distribution
OL,8,Fcentre, in an attack that Ukraine's
OL,9,Fleader has called "utterly horrific".
OL,11,FFive people were injured and 27
OL,12,Finitially reported missing after at
OL,13,Fleast nine 3,000kg aerial bombs hit the
OL,14,Fvillage of Komyshuvakha in the southern
OL,15,FZaporizhzhia region, regional head
OL,16,FMykhailo Semikin said.
OL,18,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said that
OL,19,Fafter the first strike on the local
OL,20,Fschool "used for humanitarian needs",
OL,21,Fthere was a second attack on the place
OL,22,Fwhere people were sheltering.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
